  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "ヤマト、再び発進の時。",
      "en": "Yamato, time to take off again."
    },
    {
      "ja": "『宇宙戦艦ヤマト2202』に登場のヤマト2202版が1/1000スケールで、いよいよ登場！",
      "en": "The Yamato 2202 version that appeared in \"Space Battleship Yamato 2202\" is finally available in 1/1000 Scale!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 精密なディテールでヤマト2202を再現！",
      "en": "• Reproduce Yamato 2202 with precise details!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 新規パーツで第4艦橋の展開と、安定翼の展開・収納を再現。",
      "en": "• New parts reproduce the deployment of the 4th bridge and the deployment and storage of the stabilizing wings."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 2202版に合わせた「LEDユニット(青)」が付属し、波動砲と艦橋部の発光が再現可能。",
      "en": "• An \"LED unit (blue)\" that matches the 2202 version is included, allowing you to reproduce the light emission of the wave motion gun and the bridge."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 別売りの「発光ユニット(白)2灯式」と付属のオレンジのクリアパーツを使用すれば、エンジンの発光も再現可能。",
      "en": "• If you use the separately sold \"Light-emitting unit (white) 2-lamp type\" and the included orange clear parts, you can also reproduce the engine's light emission."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• メカコレクション ゆうなぎが付属。",
      "en": "• Mecha Collection Yuunagi is included."
    }
  ],
